          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "యుద్ధభూమి — yuddhabhūmi — \"a battlefield\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "యుద్ధభూమిలో రెండు సైన్యాలు ఎదురయ్యాయి. yuddhabhūmilō reṇḍu sainyālu edurayyāyi. Two armies met on the battlefield."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "యుద్ధం, war, and భూమి, ground."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "యుద్ధభూమి (yuddhabhūmi) is borrowed from Sanskrit: yuddha, \"battle\" (CDIAL 10499), and bhūmi, \"earth, ground\" (CDIAL 9557)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
