          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "దళం (daḷaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit dala, \"a party, a band\" (CDIAL 6215); CDIAL notes that this sense may come from Dravidian."
            }
          ]
        },
